    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steampunk x Maze Adventure! Dice Rolls Determine Your Fate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate steampunk world, you take on the role of a doll navigating through a 13-floor maze filled with randomly arranged hexagonal tiles. Various events, such as healing items, treasure chests, and dangerous enemy encounters, await at every step. The outcome of each event is determined by dice rolls, adding an exciting tension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique adventure that combines beautiful steampunk design with the distinct mechanics of controlling a doll. Immerse yourself in a world of steampunk and strategy as you make your way to the top floor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic click adventure on randomly arranged hexagonal tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension-filled dice rolls that decide the outcome of every event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of random events like healing, battles, treasure chests, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of steampunk visuals and a dystopian world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling 13-floor journey as you aim for the top!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steampunk x Maze Adventure! Dice Rolls Determine Your Fate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate steampunk world, you take on the role of a doll navigating through a 13-floor maze filled with randomly arranged hexagonal tiles. Various events, such as healing items, treasure chests, and dangerous enemy encounters, await at every step. The outcome of each event is determined by dice rolls, adding an exciting tension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique adventure that combines beautiful steampunk design with the distinct mechanics of controlling a doll. Immerse yourself in a world of steampunk and strategy as you make your way to the top floor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic click adventure on randomly arranged hexagonal tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension-filled dice rolls that decide the outcome of every event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of random events like healing, battles, treasure chests, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of steampunk visuals and a dystopian world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling 13-floor journey as you aim for the top!</p></li></ul>",
